  "contentHtml": "<p>간단한 도구(핸드폰 액정 보호 유리, 일반거울, 일반 레이저 )로도 마이켈슨 몰리 간섭계 실험을 성공했다는 외국자료가 있어서 한번 해봤는데,</p><p>실패네요... TT</p><p>무엇이 문제일까요?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>사용 재료: 핸드폰 액정 보호유리, 360도 차량용 거울,&#160; 532nm 레이저</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/883d5daa627881a638e031c62ea1fdc0c775b48f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/883d5daa627881a638e031c62ea1fdc0c775b48f\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2587e1093af448a9448c60bb4b26c50f90a2cdef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2587e1093af448a9448c60bb4b26c50f90a2cdef\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db12ef95b7cb76f51e1ea0299169ae2874949aa5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db12ef95b7cb76f51e1ea0299169ae2874949aa5\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
